# Temple of Power counts only red sources. Bot1 cast Ojer Axonil on turn 1 (Mox Ruby, Mountain, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet); Bot2 cast Ornithopter and killed it on
# turn 2 with two Lightning Bolts, and it came back tapped and transformed as Temple of Power (CR 712.14a). Turn 5: Black Lotus for {R}{R}{R}. Lightning
# Bolt deals 3 to Bot2 and Pyrite Spellbomb, a colorless artifact, 2 to Bot2's Ornithopter: 5 noncombat damage, but only 3
# from a red source, so the Temple is refused with mana to pay. Then Firebolt deals 2 more to Bot2 and it transforms.

